ndler. This was causing a race condition where\nasynchronous policy updates interfered with node registration,\nresulting in new OIDC nodes receiving incomplete network maps.\n\nThe policy manager is still updated synchronously during user\ncreation, and handleRegistration now sends a single consolidated\nchange notification after node registration completes.\n\nAdd integration test to validate OIDC nodes immediately receive\ncorrect ACL policies and can see advertised routes without\nrequiring a client restart.\n\nRegression introduced in 1553f0ab (state: introduce state).\n\nFixes #2888\nFixes #2896\n\nSigned-off-by: Kristoffer Dalby <kristoffer@tailscale.com>","parents":[{"sha":"7e8cee6b106453d907c7f5cd3774dfcf54fe2ce3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/7e8cee6b106453d907c7f5cd3774dfcf54fe2ce3","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/7e8cee6b106453d907c7f5cd3774dfcf54fe2ce3"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":21257054231,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887YJGXYzwAAAATzBOgX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/21257054231","actor":{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/